      {
        "h": "A diagram for the deck's picture slide",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "t": "p",
            "text": "The same cluster walkthrough as the diagram test page, here to give the deck one picture slide."
          },
          {
            "t": "diagram",
            "caption": "An order inside the prod cluster, namespace by namespace. Green boxes are the cluster's own services, blue its stores and queues, grey the edge; the amber boundary is the data namespace.",
